# Local one-off screenshot/measurement scripts and the PNGs they spit out. Run
# by hand while eyeballing layout, never by the build. Each pattern is anchored
# to the repo root with a leading slash so scripts/ — the real build tooling
# package.json calls — keeps being tracked.
/check-*.mjs
/verify-*.mjs
/screenshot*.mjs
/hero-*.png
